## Task Execution Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API
    participant Router
    participant Agent
    participant Handler
    participant Storage

    User->>API: POST /api/chat
    API->>Router: Route message
    Router-->>API: specialization
    
    API->>Agent: Pick agent
    Agent-->>API: agent instance
    
    API->>Agent: execute(work)
    Agent->>Handler: dispatch(spec, work)
    
    alt LLM available
        Handler->>LLM: complete()
        LLM-->>Handler: result
    end
    
    Handler-->>Agent: outcome
    Agent-->>API: {ok, result, elapsed}
    
    API->>Storage: insert_task()
    API-->>User: {task_id, outcome}
```

